# Vocal bursts — measured recipes (2026-09-02)

Written from `$SC/out/vb_lever/vl_agg.json`; no number here was typed by hand. Full study
`~/reports/burst_levers.md`, protocol §51, German summary `~/status_vocal_burst_levers.html`.

This closes the gap `index.md` names at its end: *"71 adapters exist … but the combination study
did not cover them, so there is no operating point to write down."* There is now.

## The 12 classes with a recipe

Everything below is family-relaxed hit rate — the owner accepted a neighbouring class as a
success, and that decision is load-bearing: for five of these classes the **strict** rate is
below 0.05 while the family rate is above 0.45. The model reliably makes a sound of the right
family and does not honour the sub-label.

`N` is how many candidates to generate so at least one realises with 90 % probability. `N cons.`
uses the hit rate minus one seed-noise standard deviation (0.068), because every recipe here is an
argmax over ~35 cells and is therefore optimistic by about that much.

| class | weight | prompt form | hit (fam) | conservative | strict | N | N cons. |
|---|--:|---|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|
| [`vb/relief_sigh`](patterns/vb-relief_sigh.md) | 0.8 | GENERAL-Ursache | **0.75** | 0.68 | 0.00 | 2 | 3 |
| [`vb/chuckle`](patterns/vb-chuckle.md) | 2 | GENERAL-Ursache + längere Dauer | **0.73** | 0.66 | 0.38 | 2 | 3 |
| [`vb/contented_sigh`](patterns/vb-contented_sigh.md) | 1.5 | GENERAL-Ursache + längere Dauer | **0.68** | 0.61 | 0.68 | 3 | 3 |
| [`vb/soft_hum`](patterns/vb-soft_hum.md) | 2 | GENERAL-Ursache + längere Dauer | **0.68** | 0.61 | 0.30 | 3 | 3 |
| [`vb/cackle`](patterns/vb-cackle.md) | 1.8 | Grundform | **0.54** | 0.47 | 0.02 | 3 | 4 |
| [`vb/clears_throat`](patterns/vb-clears_throat.md) | 1.25 | Satzgrenze | **0.48** | 0.41 | 0.00 | 4 | 5 |
| [`vb/low_mumble`](patterns/vb-low_mumble.md) | 2 | GENERAL-Ursache + längere Dauer | **0.48** | 0.41 | 0.45 | 4 | 5 |
| [`vb/childlike_giggle`](patterns/vb-childlike_giggle.md) | 0.8 | Grundform | **0.47** | 0.40 | 0.05 | 4 | 5 |
| [`vb/frustrated_groan`](patterns/vb-frustrated_groan.md) | 2 | GENERAL-Ursache | **0.27** | 0.20 | 0.00 | 8 | 11 |
| [`vb/exhausted_groan`](patterns/vb-exhausted_groan.md) | 1.8 | Grundform | **0.22** | 0.15 | 0.22 | 10 | 15 |
| [`vb/surprised_gasp`](patterns/vb-surprised_gasp.md) | 1 | längere Dauer | **0.18** | 0.11 | 0.17 | 12 | 19 |
